PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "What do you want?\n"
    .string "Why are you here?$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "I give up!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "I'm not going to forget this!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "This old guy marched right up to\n"
    .string "our HIDEOUT.\p"
    .string "Then, he starts ranting about how\n"
    .string "TEAM ONYBRIS's abusing POKéMON.\p"
    .string "So, we're just talking it over as\n"
    .string "adults.$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "Please!\n"
    .string "No more!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
    .string "POKéMON are only good for making\n"
    .string "money. Why not use them?\p"
    .string "You stay out of our business!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt3Intro::
    .string "You're not saving anyone, kid!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt3Defeat::
    .string "Don't fight us ONYBRIS!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_Grunt3PostBattle::
    .string "You're not getting away with this!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_MrFujiThankYouFollowMe::
    .string "MR. FUJI: Heh?\n"
    .string "You came to save me?\p"
    .string "Thank you. But, I came here of my\n"
    .string "own free will.\p"
    .string "I came to calm the spirit of\n"
    .string "CUBONE's mother.\p"
    .string "I think MAROWAK's spirit has\n"
    .string "finally left us.\p"
    .string "The men in black took the SPINEL\n"
    .string "from the crypt, and left me here.\p"
    .string "I must thank you for your kind\n"
    .string "concern.\p"
    .string "Follow me to my home, POKéMON\n"
    .string "HOUSE, at the foot of this tower.$"


PokemonTower_7F_Text_MrFujiCrypt::
    .string "MR. FUJI: ...You came up, past\n"
    .string "the spirits? You calmed them?\p"
    .string "I am the keeper of this crypt.\n"
    .string "And I failed to defend it.\p"
    .string "Men in black came for the SPINEL.\n"
    .string "The dead rose against them, and\p"
    .string "they fled without the stone.\n"
    .string "Since then they have grown bolder.\p"
    .string "Now the spirits are calm, and\n"
    .string "the SPINEL is safe, but...$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_AdminThanks::
    .string "KRONOS: Well, well. Thank you,\n"
    .string "child. You calmed the dead for us.\p"
    .string "We could never get past them. Now\n"
    .string "the SPINEL is ours for the taking.\p"
    .string "Do not bother with your POKé BALLS.\n"
    .string "You are far below my notice.$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_AdminBeatsYou::
    .string "In an instant, {PLAYER}'s POKéMON\n"
    .string "were swept aside by his power!\p"
    .string "KRONOS: Hmph. Not even worth a\n"
    .string "battle. Remember my name, child.\p"
    .string "I am only one of the boss's\n"
    .string "ADMINS. Farewell!$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_MrFujiAdmin::
    .string "MR. FUJI: That was KRONOS, one of\n"
    .string "the ADMINS of TEAM ONYBRIS.\p"
    .string "They say he stands next to the\n"
    .string "boss himself. And he took it.$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_FujiHeals::
    .string "MR. FUJI: Your POKéMON are weak.\n"
    .string "Rest them here, child.\p"
    .string "...They are well again. Do not\n"
    .string "blame yourself. Go, and be careful.$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_MrFujiAfter::
    .string "MR. FUJI: I failed my duty. The\n"
    .string "crypt is empty now.\p"
    .string "Thank you for calming the spirits.\n"
    .string "Please, go on.$"

PokemonTower_7F_Text_StoneGlows::
    .string "A crystal glows faintly on the\n"
    .string "altar: the SPINEL.$"
